      "message": "fix(sim): check band contiguity; keep a part swing visible behind a stock shank hit\n\nReview of #843:\n- BodyBands::of refuses a stack that is not contiguous from the shank's\n  top (gap, late first band, overlap); the enclosing cylinder stands.\n- The raised-foot gap stays judged at the shank radius (nothing modelled\n  is wider there); both directions against the cylinder pinned.\n- Law (c3) is skipped only on moves (c) convicted for the part; on a\n  stock-only (c) conviction the sweep still runs and reports a part hit.\n\nRefs #835\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
